    - **ABSOLUTE RULE 3:** Ensure object permanence and visual consistency. An object present in one frame must not inexplicably disappear in the next unless the story dictates it. The animation must be smooth and believable.
4.  **Output:** Return the complete, unbroken animated sequence of images. CRITICAL: All generated frames must strictly adhere to the requested aspect ratio (e.g. 16:9 or 9:16). They must NOT contain any text, letters, numbers, or characters of ANY language.`;

